  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: Document information dictionary API. New Document methods AddTitle, AddAuthor, AddSubject, AddKeywords, AddCreator, AddCreationDate, and SuppressCreationDate stage values for the PDF /Info dictionary. CreationDate is auto-stamped at Close() unless suppressed. Backward compatible (existing 1.0.0 callers see only the new /CreationDate key; SuppressCreationDate() restores the 1.0.0 output shape exactly). Adds DabblerPdf.Utilities.PdfDate for PDF 1.7 §7.9.4 date formatting.",
